wo modules."}, {"id": "devview_networkmock_claude_previewsheetstate", "label": "PreviewSheetState state machine", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "devview-networkmock/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sealed interface Hidden/Single/Compare cycles via transition(response): Hidden -> Single -> Compare (2nd long-press) -> back to Single (deselect one) -> Hidden (deselect last). Selection identity is the whole MockResponse (effectively its (statusCode, exampleName) pair), not a file name."}, {"id": "devview_networkmock_claude_diff_pipeline", "label": "Diff rendering pipeline (LCS-based)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "devview-networkmock/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "devview_networkmock_claude_modelutils", "label": "ModelUtils.kt status colors/icons + fake() previews", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "devview-networkmock/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "devview_networkmock_claude_search_version_filter", "label": "Search & version filter kept in composable, not ViewModel", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "devview-networkmock/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NetworkMockScreen's search query and per-tab selected version are plain remember{mutableStateOf} in ContentState \u2014 both are pure client-side filters over data the ViewModel already loaded, so there's no reason to round-trip them through NetworkMockUiState."}, {"id": "devview_networkmock_claude_reset_to_network", "label": "Reset to Network toolbar action", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "devview-networkmock/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Wired via a MutableSharedFlow<Unit> (capacity 1, DROP_OLDEST). resetAllToNetwork() resets every operation in the parsed config (not just those stored in DataStore) to avoid gaps for operations the user has never touched."}], "edges": [{"source": "devview_networkmock_claude_networkmock", "target": "devview_networkmock_api_api_networkmock", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "devview-networkmock/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "devview_networkmock_claude_networkmockviewmodel", "target": "devview_networkmock_api_api_networkmockviewmodel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "devview-networkmock/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "devview_networkmock_claude_networkmockendpointviewmodel", "target": "devview_networkmock_api_api_networkmockendpointviewmodel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "devview-networkmock/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "devview_networkmock_claude_networkmockdestination", "target": "devview_networkmock_api_api_networkmockdestination", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "devview-networkmock/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "devview_networkmock_claude_search_version_filter", "target": "docs_modules_networkmock_ui_mainscreen", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "devview-networkmock/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "devview_networkmock_claude_diff_pipeline", "target": "docs_modules_networkmock_ui_endpointdetail", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "devview-networkmock/CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weigh